# Notion QR Code — hundreds of avatar sprites (Skia Picture rebuilt per frame on
# the UI thread from a sprite sheet) orbit on a rotating torus; the CONNECT
# button springs them (Hungarian-matched) into the reactiive.io QR code and
# back, with per-step haptics and a staggered rotation freeze.
# What this test covers: torus -> QR, QR -> torus, toggling again mid-morph in
# both directions (spring re-targeted while the stagger is running), a burst of
# quick toggles, taps on the canvas away from the button (no-op), and a final
# settle in the QR state then back.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/notion-qrcode"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 45000
# Warm-up touch on the status bar: the first touch of a test can be lost while
# the XCTest runner attaches.
press 330 20
wait 500
wait "text" "CONNECT" 10000
wait 1500
press 201 762
wait 3000
wait "text" "SHARE" 5000
press 201 762
wait 3000
wait "text" "CONNECT" 5000
press 201 762
wait 600
press 201 762
wait 600
press 201 762
wait 3000
press 201 762 --count 5 --interval-ms 150
wait 3500
press 201 437
wait 1000
press 100 300
wait 1000
press 201 762
wait 3000
press 201 762
wait 3000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
